  "full_text": "So I'm at a, I was driving from Vegas to Phoenix, and I'm not in any hurry, I just, I'm probably only maybe an hour and a half out of Vegas. It's in the middle of nowhere. So we were talking about, we don't really want to overpopulate our kingdom, do we? God said we're a Grinch. And I was gonna just, for example, this is, we're in the middle of the desert, right? So, like, I'm just gonna, like, do a, I don't know if you can see this, but, like, if I can show, like, how many lights there are all the way around. So, there's kind of a few, like, peripheral lights around this little area. I think there's a little town over there. But, like, mostly it's just nothing. Like, straight out there, there's, like, there's like nothing you know and just the road so it's kind of cool so like yeah that's the best part yeah it's cool like when you go out to like when you get from there it's like nothing it's kind of cool",
